# FSD + Figma HTML Pipeline — System Context (.cursor only)

Authoritative process docs live **under `.cursor/`** (this file + agent + skills + rules).

## Purpose

Stage 0: **FSD (source of truth)** + **Figma HTML (UI/nav assist)** → use cases → Excel in Milestone2 Test Cases → gate → `qa-automation-pipeline` → Playwright under `tests/milestone2/`.

## Priority

| Source | Role |
|--------|------|
| FSD `.docx` | Requirements, rules, expected results, use-case scope |
| Figma HTML | Navigation, screens, labels, controls for steps/locators |

**Conflicts → FSD wins.**

## Folder layout (canonical)

```
pipeline/test-data/Milestone2/
  FSD/           # place / select FSD .docx files
  Figma/         # place / select Figma HTML files
  Test Cases/    # generated Excel test-case workbooks written here
```

User **names** which files to use each run. Do not auto-pick an arbitrary file when multiple exist without confirmation.

